  "description": "The CLASH 24 is perfect for young riders looking for a playful bike, 24-inch wheels and 145mm of travel.\n• The MANITOU Machete Junit Pro fork, developed in collaboration with the American brand, offers maximum comfort for young riders. The RockShox Deluxe Select shock has simple yet effective adjustments. Its pneumatic spring can be tuned precisely to the rider’s weight.\n• Stopping power is managed by TEKTRO with a pair of HD-J2820 2-piston brakes. They are powerful and feature lever reach adjustment to fit all hand sizes.\n• The MICROSHIFT Advent X 8-speed drivetrain features a wide 11-48t range. Reliable and precise for tackling transitions with confidence. Cranks are shortened to 140mm.\n• SPANK Spike Spoon 28 wheels guarantee reliability and strength.",
